{
  "description": "用户要求复用时将当前内容提炼到我的资产库。scope:objects(默认)取绑定多选或 path 对象；scope:page取 path 页面；scope:structure以 pages 指定 project.list/read 实际页面路径，省略取已授权工程全部页面。保留布局、状态、Flow/Spatial、内部导航及必需主题/资源，软件处理身份与依赖；外部关联给出诊断。可附 title/description/标签，之后 asset.search/use复用，无需手列对象身份。",
  "inputSchema": {
    "$defs": {
      "__schema0": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "__schema1": {
        "items": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": "array"
      }
    },
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "description": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "pages": {
        "items": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema0"
        },
        "minItems": 1,
        "type": "array"
      },
      "path": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "project": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "schoolStage": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema1"
      },
      "scope": {
        "enum": [
          "objects",
          "page",
          "structure"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "subject": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema1"
      },
      "tags": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema1"
      },
      "title": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "静态目录只说明已登记接口；当前运行是否可调用、文档范围、写权限、短句柄和服务配置，以宿主本轮发现与实际回执为准。",
  "manual": {
    "group": "edit",
    "label": "asset.save",
    "targetKinds": []
  },
  "name": "asset.save",
  "version": 1
}
